{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 756150,
  "courseSlug": "the-complete-guide-to-angular-2",
  "courseTitle": "Angular - The Complete Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "44129810",
      "title": "Working with Nested Form Groups",
      "lectureOrder": 261,
      "videoOrder": 249,
      "sourceHash": "0208abdd9b8b93e7c5a0732937a4e59d0e853c4d34a943eb0889d32ecfedadaa",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.75,
          "end": 1.86,
          "en": "As you can tell,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 1.86,
          "end": 6.06,
          "en": "this form which we built here is a bit more complex,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.06,
          "end": 7.74,
          "en": "not super complex,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.74,
          "end": 12.74,
          "en": "but it does have more than just two or three form controls.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.2,
          "end": 16.08,
          "en": "Now some of these form controls like street, number,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.08,
          "end": 20.19,
          "en": "postal code and city also kind of belong together,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.19,
          "end": 22.293,
          "en": "or password and confirmPassword.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.19,
          "end": 24.99,
          "en": "And we can also see that visually.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.99,
          "end": 27.21,
          "en": "These two are next to each other.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.21,
          "end": 30.843,
          "en": "These are in this address group here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.71,
          "end": 33.69,
          "en": "Now you might wanna reflect",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.69,
          "end": 36.63,
          "en": "that structure in your form model.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 36.63,
          "end": 39.48,
          "en": "So in that formGroup you are setting up in your code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.48,
          "end": 42.33,
          "en": "because that might make working with it easier.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 42.33,
          "end": 45.84,
          "en": "It might make extracting data more logical.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 45.84,
          "end": 47.64,
          "en": "And therefore you don't have to do it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 47.64,
          "end": 50.43,
          "en": "but you might want to add some structure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 50.43,
          "end": 52.11,
          "en": "to your formGroup here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 52.11,
          "end": 55.893,
          "en": "and you might want to add some nested formGroups.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 56.88,
          "end": 58.68,
          "en": "And that's something that you can do,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 58.68,
          "end": 62.82,
          "en": "and that is thankfully pretty easy to do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 62.82,
          "end": 66.18,
          "en": "For example, if we wanna group these passwords together,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 66.18,
          "end": 69.81,
          "en": "we could add a property named passwords here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 69.81,
          "end": 71.493,
          "en": "This name also is up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 72.53999999999999,
          "end": 75.63,
          "en": "And this would now not be a new form control,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 75.63,
          "end": 77.81700000000001,
          "en": "but instead a new formGroup,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 78.81,
          "end": 82.68,
          "en": "just as the overall form is a formGroup.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 82.68,
          "end": 85.35,
          "en": "But you're not limited to using a formGroup",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 85.35,
          "end": 87.21000000000001,
          "en": "just to create a form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 87.21000000000001,
          "end": 89.55,
          "en": "Instead, you can also have nested formGroups",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 89.55,
          "end": 93.12,
          "en": "to add structure to your form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 93.12,
          "end": 96.69,
          "en": "This will also later help us with creating a validator",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 96.69,
          "end": 100.233,
          "en": "that validates these two controls together.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 101.13,
          "end": 104.46000000000001,
          "en": "Now, just as with the main formGroup up here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 104.46000000000001,
          "end": 107.77199999999999,
          "en": "you have to pass an object to the formGroup.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 107.77199999999999,
          "end": 111.36,
          "en": "And now we just move these two controls into",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 111.36,
          "end": 113.46000000000001,
          "en": "this nested formGroup.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 113.46000000000001,
          "end": 115.743,
          "en": "And that's almost all.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 117.33,
          "end": 119.03999999999999,
          "en": "With that, if you would save this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 119.03999999999999,
          "end": 121.08,
          "en": "you would get an error though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 121.08,
          "end": 124.8,
          "en": "that Angular now fails to connect the password",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 124.8,
          "end": 127.32,
          "en": "and confirmPassword inputs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 127.32,
          "end": 129.933,
          "en": "It fails to find these controls.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 131.22,
          "end": 134.01,
          "en": "Because they're now in a nested formGroup",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 134.01,
          "end": 137.46,
          "en": "and you must reflect that in your template",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 137.46,
          "end": 140.343,
          "en": "when connecting it to your form controls.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 141.78,
          "end": 144.18,
          "en": "Specifically here where the password",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 144.18,
          "end": 148.56,
          "en": "and confirmPassword inputs are now in a nested formGroup,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 148.56,
          "end": 151.41,
          "en": "you also have to add this link",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 151.41,
          "end": 155.4,
          "en": "to this nested formGroup on some shared parent element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 155.4,
          "end": 156.903,
          "en": "in this template.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 157.98,
          "end": 160.2,
          "en": "So here, for example, this div,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 160.2,
          "end": 164.1,
          "en": "this control-row div, includes both the password",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 164.1,
          "end": 167.25,
          "en": "and the confirm-password inputs in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 167.25,
          "end": 169.26,
          "en": "and therefore you can go to it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 169.26,
          "end": 171.93,
          "en": "and add a special directive on it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 171.93,
          "end": 175.95,
          "en": "The formGroup directive we already saw before",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 175.95,
          "end": 178.47,
          "en": "for connecting the overall form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 178.47,
          "end": 182.01,
          "en": "We can also use it to connect a nested formGroup.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 182.01,
          "end": 185.943,
          "en": "So in this case, form.controls.passwords.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 187.35,
          "end": 190.05,
          "en": "But just with form controls,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 190.05,
          "end": 193.383,
          "en": "writing that full path here can be annoying.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 194.22,
          "end": 197.943,
          "en": "That's why Angular also gives you a formGroupName property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 199.38,
          "end": 200.49,
          "en": "which you can use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 200.49,
          "end": 203.52,
          "en": "for registering nested formGroups.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 203.52,
          "end": 205.98,
          "en": "Now it's just the formGroupName,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 205.98,
          "end": 209.253,
          "en": "which in my case is passwords, that's passed here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 210.27,
          "end": 212.79,
          "en": "And with that everything's good again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 212.79,
          "end": 214.14,
          "en": "the error goes away",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 214.14,
          "end": 216.537,
          "en": "and these two are now in a formGroup.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 217.5,
          "end": 219.96,
          "en": "And we can see that if we submit the form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 219.96,
          "end": 223.65,
          "en": "now we can see that formGroup here in the controls.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 223.65,
          "end": 225.813,
          "en": "We got the passwords formGroup here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 226.82999999999998,
          "end": 230.26,
          "en": "and if we expand that, we got the nested controls",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 231.96,
          "end": 234.96,
          "en": "and we also see that in the form value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 234.96,
          "end": 237.54,
          "en": "There we now got that passwords object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 237.54,
          "end": 241.05,
          "en": "which is now a nested object that contains the data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 241.05,
          "end": 244.11,
          "en": "for these two confirmPassword",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 244.11,
          "end": 245.79,
          "en": "and password controls",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 245.79,
          "end": 249.303,
          "en": "that make up this passwords form control group.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 250.65,
          "end": 253.05,
          "en": "So that's how you can add structure,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 253.05,
          "end": 256.2,
          "en": "and we can do the same now for the address data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 256.2,
          "end": 261.2,
          "en": "Here after lastName, we can add an address property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 261.39,
          "end": 263.103,
          "en": "which is also a formGroup.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 264.81,
          "end": 267.63,
          "en": "And then here we also pass a object to that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 267.63,
          "end": 271.11,
          "en": "and now we can move street, number, postalCode",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 271.11,
          "end": 274.593,
          "en": "and city into this address formGroup.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 276,
          "end": 279.45,
          "en": "And just as before we now just also have to make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 279.45,
          "end": 281.883,
          "en": "that our connections still work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 282.78,
          "end": 286.56,
          "en": "So in this case, I got this fieldSet element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 286.56,
          "end": 291.56,
          "en": "that acts as a wrapper around all these address inputs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 291.65999999999997,
          "end": 295.11,
          "en": "and therefore we can add the formGroupName directive on that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 295.11,
          "end": 297.39300000000003,
          "en": "and give it that name of address,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 298.32,
          "end": 301.263,
          "en": "which is that name I chose here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 302.61,
          "end": 305.94,
          "en": "With that, this also still works if I reload that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 305.94,
          "end": 308.34,
          "en": "And again, if I submit this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 308.34,
          "end": 312.15,
          "en": "we now also have this nested address data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 312.15,
          "end": 313.59,
          "en": "And as you can already see,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 313.59,
          "end": 317.37,
          "en": "that already made this value object a bit more readable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 317.37,
          "end": 320.07,
          "en": "because we're now working with some nested objects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 320.07,
          "end": 323.76,
          "en": "to give this a structure that makes a bit more sense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 323.76,
          "end": 327.303,
          "en": "So that's how we can work with nested formGroups.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
